== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Dispensers''' can be placed as a block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}}. When activated from a [[Redstone]] signal, it will act like a {{Item|Dropper}} and [[mcw:Dropper#Usage|drop an item]] from its inventory, rather than [[mcw:Dispenser#Usage|dispense]] one. There are also [[Private Island#Redstone Restrictions|restrictions]] on how often this can be done. Dispensers cannot be placed in {{Zone|The Garden}}.

